LittleRed (at Hidden Tunnel): [I can't let the BigBadWolf stop me, but the cost of a memory is scary!] *trembling slightly, deep in thought* "If I let go of a memory, will I still be me? But Grandma... she needs me!"
The mist enveloped her, swirling with echoes of past moments, as she weighed the potential loss against her grandmother's safety.
LittleRed (at Hidden Tunnel): [This is so scary, but Grandma needs me more than I need all my memories.] *takes a deep, shaky breath, steps forward with tears in her eyes* "I don't know what I'll forget, but it's worth it to keep Grandma safe. I'll be strong for her!"
