The glow from the staff intensified, casting a warm light that rapidly flickered and waned, plunging the forest into an uneasy twilight. Suddenly, heavy footsteps rustled the underbrush all around, growing louder as if an unseen force approached relentlessly, making the forest tremble with impending danger.
