LittleRed deciphers the ancient symbols, realizing they map a series of hidden paths to outwit the BigBadWolf.
As LittleRed prepared to follow the hidden paths, the forest's trees subtly shifted, their branches intertwining to obscure the trails, crafted by the BigBadWolf's trickery. The oppressive sound of snapping twigs echoed, revealing his clever deterrent. The forest spirits' whispers pointed LittleRed toward the force of unity within her.
