LittleRed grips her staff tightly, eyes narrowing as she searches for truth, her heart refusing to be swayed by the Wolf's lies.
LittleRed (at Forest): [I mustn't let the BigBadWolf's lies get me—I'll rely on my heart and Grandma's wisdom.] *holds the staff tightly, eyes filled with confidence and warmth* "I'm not falling for your tricks, BigBadWolf! The symbols and my heart's light will show me the way. With Grandma's love guiding me, I'll see through your illusions and find the real path."
