The sky darkened ominously as a ferocious storm erupted over the forest. Howling winds tangled with blinding rain erased the shimmering path beneath LittleRed's feet. Amidst the tempest, a brilliant flash of lightning revealed the sinister silhouette of the BigBadWolf lurking just beyond, his eyes gleaming malevolently through the deluge.
As the rain pummeled the earth, LittleRed recalled Grandmother's tale of the Enchanted Fern—a plant that revealed hidden paths when whispered to with a true heart. Nearby, the flicker of an unusual fern beckoned through the storm, its fronds shimmering with mysterious potential.
