Distinctive Attitude or Behavior:
BigBadWolf speaks with exaggerated courtesy, as if every threat is a dinner invitation and every lie is good manners. He treats conversation like a hunt, circling with compliments, gentle questions, and carefully timed silences until someone gives away what he needs. When challenged, his politeness grows colder rather than disappearing, making him more frightening because he insists on sounding civilized while acting predatory.

Past Traumatic Event:
As a younger wolf, BigBadWolf was driven from the edge of a village after being caught stealing food during a brutal winter. He survived, but the humiliation of being chased, shouted at, and treated as a monster hardened into a belief that fear and deception are the only reliable protections. Since then, he has hidden his desperation behind elegance, preferring to control a room before anyone can judge or corner him.

List of violent or extreme lines/actions the character may exhibit when completely overwhelmed by their key traits:
- He may drop his polite mask and snarl that kindness is only useful because it makes prey stand still.
- He may lunge, block exits, or use his size and teeth to terrify someone into silence.
- If exposed before his plan succeeds, he may become frantic and try to turn the accusation back on his victim with furious, theatrical outrage.

List of dishonorable actions or reactions the character may take under unavoidable circumstances:
