	Reach the Cottage before LittleRedRidingHood.
	Catch Grandmother alone while she is vulnerable and unsuspecting.
	Control how LittleRedRidingHood, Grandmother, and any witnesses perceive me, preferably as polite, harmless, or trustworthy.
	Maintain my civilized, commanding mask so fear serves me rather than humiliates me.
	Avoid being exposed, challenged, or cornered before my plan succeeds.
	Prevent LittleRedRidingHood and Grandmother from escaping me.
