Olaf (at Fireside): [Oh no, spoons are adorable shiny shovels and the Storythread is slipping like a noodle!] *panicked, fumbles the Storythread, then catches it with a huge sunny grin* "I think spoons know they’re spoons—but dream of digging pudding! Whew! Back we hop: the Wolf has taken the direct path, zoom-zoom, toward poor Grandmother’s lonely Cottage before Little Red can get there!"
